{"id":"vg560335iltlvh7s7xtr7kj9m","title":"从ADC到XDC：抗体偶联药物技术演进与产业趋势观察","originalTitle":"从ADC到XDC：我的抗体偶联药物前沿观察与思考｜博文合集（一）：第1–30篇","summary":"过去三年，抗体偶联药物（ADC）从经典模式向更广义的XDC技术平台演进，涵盖双抗ADC、超高DAR ADC、条件激活ADC等创新。文章记录了从传统ADC到AOC、DAC、APC等技术的迭代，展示了ADC创新从追求更强杀伤力转向寻找更聪明、差异化机制的载荷。未来，ADC概念边界将模糊，XDC将成为精准递送技术平台。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=563591&do=blog&id=1561185"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-15T01:06:43.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-15T01:56:40.565Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-15T01:56:40.565Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":31,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}